Subject: [PATCH] unicode: pretok blob + ASCII bulk cpt decode for mixed (0121)

General-path pretok blob (skip N strings) and 8-wide ASCII cpt fill
before unicode_cpt_from_utf8. See docs/faster-bpe-tokenize.md (M15d / 0121).
---
